### Secrets — PHAI dung dau tien ###
# Nhanh nay tung chua mot ung dung Spring Boot. Ba thu muc duoi day la artifact
# cuc bo con sot lai VA chua credential that:
#
#   config/   - application-*.yml, supabase.env, vm_key (private SSH key)
#   .env      - DB_PASSWORD cua docker compose
#
# Da tung suyt commit ca config/ vi ban .gitignore truoc thieu hai dong nay.
# Dung xoa chung.
/config/
.env
.env.local
*.pem
*.key
!**/*.key.example

### Build output ###
# target/ la output cua Maven, con sot tu ung dung Spring Boot truoc day.
target/
dist/
build/
logs/

### Node ###
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
*.log

### IDE ###
.idea
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

### Kiro ###
# mcp.json chua connection string kem password, khong commit.
.kiro/settings/mcp.json
# Steering (.kiro/steering/*.md) thi CO commit, do la tai lieu cho ca team.

### OS ###
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
